  SOLAR REALMS ELITE
  Unpacking/Upgrading Instructions
컴컴컴컴컴컴컴컴컴컴컴컴컴컴컴컴컴컴컴컴컴컴컴컴컴컴컴컴컴컴컴컴컴컴컴컴

1.  Run
        UNPACK -y
    to unpack the rest of the files.  This is all you have to do if
    you are upgrading.

2.  Run
        INSTALL
    if you are installing for the first time, or if you wish to
    change some of the score file, fossil driver, or locked baud
    rate settings.

3.  Set up your BBS software to run SRE.BAT when the user wishes
    to play SRE.  (See your BBS manual if you do not know how to do this.)

4.  Reset the game with
       SRE RESET

